{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"In ResStock 2025 Release 1:\n\n- **49% of housing units** are in one-story buildings, according to the Geometry Stories stock saturation table.\n- **Data source:** U.S. Energy Information Administration’s **2009 Residential Energy Consumption Survey (RECS) microdata**.\n- **Basements are excluded** from the story count. Stories are floors above grade; **finished attics are included**.\n\nSource: [ResStock 2025 Release 1 Technical Reference Guide, “Geometry Stories,” p. 54, Table 11](https://natlabrockies.github.io/ResStock.github.io/assets/trd/ResStockTechnicalReferenceGuide_2025_1.pdf#page=54)."}}
